.TH BBCAT-GTK 1 "July 2026" "bbcat-gnome" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
bbcat-gtk \- GTK4 viewer for ANSI and BBS artwork
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bbcat-gtk
.RI [ FILE ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B bbcat-gtk
opens ANSI and BBS artwork in a GTK4 desktop window.
When no file is supplied, use the Open button to choose one.
The viewer supports static and animated formats decoded by bbcat.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show application help.
.TP
.B \-\-help-gapplication
Show GApplication options.
.SH HOMEPAGE
https://github.com/EriksRemess/bbcat-gtk
